%% Component Diagram for API Code Generation Platform
%% Standards-compliant Mermaid (mmd)
flowchart TB
    subgraph Kubernetes Cluster
        SpecIngest[Specification Ingestion Interface]
        APIGen[API Code Generation Service]
        Auth[Authentication/Authorization]
        Audit[Audit Logging]
    end

    Dev[Developer]
    SpecSource[Specification Source]

    Dev -->|Uploads spec, requests code| SpecIngest
    SpecSource -->|Provides technical specs| SpecIngest
    SpecIngest -->|Validates specs| Auth
    SpecIngest -->|Sends validated specs| APIGen
    APIGen -->|Logs code generation| Audit
    SpecIngest -->|Delivers code archive| Dev
    Dev -->|Retrieves audit logs| Audit
    Auth -->|Secures endpoints, RBAC| SpecIngest
    Auth -->|Secures endpoints, RBAC| APIGen
    Auth -->|Secures endpoints, RBAC| Audit
